            message: '#abort_unless expects bool#'
            identifier: argument.type
            path: app/Livewire/Concerns/Admin/ManagesRoles.php
            count: 1
        -
            # resultGroups() maps each group through a closure whose parameter is
            # the bare class `Collection $targets`, with no template types, so
            # PHPStan reads the group's `result` as mixed and `targets` as an
            # untyped Collection. The docblock states the exact shape the page
